                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]PLUTONIUM[/h1]\n\n\nTLDR Story;\nYou live in the World of Plutonium in which everything is perfect - except it isn´t!\n\nThis 1 Hour long game is a prequel to the main game FLUTONIUM which is still in development as of the date of this review. The game is published to show the Story,Characters and idea behind it to the public.\n\nThe Story basicly involves the creation of the main character of the next Game Guardi. You start as a Molon (not Moron), You follow several of them to see what there normal day is like but at some point it switches to another person.\n\nThis will let you play as the \"main\" character in this game. Here the whole story is coming up, I wont spoil it tho.\nThe way the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=923154519]\"windowed mode\"[/url] is used in the end is great. \n\n[spoiler] If you want to see it ill link it, but if the game interests you you shouldnt. https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=923154995 [/spoiler]\n\nThe moment you get the intention of this game you will like it.\n\nFor 1,99 you can definitly try this game out. The [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=923154543] Art Style [/url] definitly has something to it. (dont worry, its no spoiler)",
